      "id": "stage01_rereference_hfb110_140_selection",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "阶段 01 新参数实验 / 110–140 Hz高频功率筛选\n\n110–140 Hz带通→Hilbert功率→每trial相对−200–0 ms基线的dB变化；100–400 ms均值。\n四类别内color vs gray ANOVA；S2≥1/4，S3≥2/4（raw p<0.05）。\n\nS2：native=18，Global CAR=30，Shaft CAR=37，bipolar=34，Laplacian=47。\nS3：native=0，Global CAR=0，Shaft CAR=5，bipolar=3，Laplacian=1。\n五种参考共同电极：S2=0，S3=0。\n\n状态：探索性、未校正；旧lf30结果未覆盖。\n来源：color_analyse_0727/result/rereference_hfb110_140_selection_20260824/",
      "x": 2040,
      "y": 6300,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 500
    },
    {
      "id": "fig_stage01_rereference_hfb110_140_selection",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "color_analyse_0727/result/rereference_hfb110_140_selection_20260824/comparison_figures/selection_counts_all_references.png",
      "x": 2740,
      "y": 6300,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 400
    },
    {
      "id": "stage03_rereference_hfb110_140_decoding",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "阶段 03 新分析 / 高频筛选电极的时间滑窗 decoding\n\ndecoding仍固定raw200的16频带STFT特征，仅筛选信号改为110–140 Hz功率。\nHFB-S2峰值赢家：Task3=native 0.587；Task2跨水果=bipolar 0.524；Task3→Task2=native 0.529；Task2→Task3=native 0.539。四项平均native=0.543第一。\nHFB-S3仅三种参考可解码：Laplacian四项平均=0.605最高，bipolar=0.568，Shaft CAR=0.552；但Laplacian仅1个电极，native/Global CAR无S3电极。\n\n状态：描述性；无置换，在81个时间点取峰值会抬高准确率。\n来源：result/rereference_hfb110_140_{s2,s3}_sliding_decoding_no_permutation_20260824/",
      "x": 2040,
      "y": 6900,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 570
    },
    {
      "id": "fig_stage03_rereference_hfb110_140_s2_decoding",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "color_analyse_0727/result/rereference_hfb110_140_s2_sliding_decoding_no_permutation_20260824/comparison_figures/all_reference_mean_decoding_curves.png",
      "x": 2740,
      "y": 6900,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 460
    },
    {
      "id": "fig_stage03_rereference_hfb110_140_s3_decoding",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "color_analyse_0727/result/rereference_hfb110_140_s3_sliding_decoding_no_permutation_20260824/comparison_figures/peak_accuracy_heatmap.png",
      "x": 3540,
      "y": 6900,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 450
    },
    {
      "id": "stage03_hfb_peak_latency_mni_y_acc055",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "阶段 03 补充图 / MNI-y与单电极decoding峰值时间\n\nHFB-S2与HFB-S3各按5种重参考绘制四项decoding，共10张图。\n仅显示peak accuracy≥0.55：663/700条记录保留（S2=630，S3=33）。\n横轴=MNI y坐标，纵轴=峰值时间；颜色=被试。点面积在accuracy 0.55–0.70间指数增长，>0.70封顶；不显示大小图例。\n\n状态：描述性；峰值来自81个时间点且未做置换检验。\n来源：color_analyse_0727/result/rereference_hfb110_140_s2_s3_peak_latency_mni_y_acc055_20260824/",
      "x": 2040,
      "y": 7600,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 450
    },
    {
      "id": "fig_stage03_hfb_s2_native_peak_latency_mni_y_acc055",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "color_analyse_0727/result/rereference_hfb110_140_s2_s3_peak_latency_mni_y_acc055_20260824/HFB-S2/reference_native/mni_y_vs_peak_latency_acc_ge_055_exponential_size.png",
      "x": 2740,
      "y": 7600,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 450
    },
    {
      "id": "fig_stage03_hfb_s3_shaft_peak_latency_mni_y_acc055",
